  <diagram id="deps-exec" name="09 相关 skill：环境与实验执行">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1900" dy="1300" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2800" pageHeight="2200" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="d9-0" />
        <mxCell id="d9-1" parent="d9-0" />
        <mxCell id="d9-title" value="Experiment Bridge 的子调用与落盘责任" style="text;html=1;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="d9-1">
          <mxGeometry x="700" y="20" width="1400" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d9-env" value="&lt;b&gt;/experiment-env-manager&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;触发：Phase 0 发现 env.json.status != complete，或 sanity 3 次失败/运行时 env error。&lt;br&gt;输入：project、mode=setup|error-report|audit、run-id、paseo-config、error-report path。&lt;br&gt;动作：写 .aris/env-config/&lt;project&gt;/env-manager-state.json；setup 模式写 prd.json；派发 /experiment-env-configuration 生成 bundle，再派发 /experiment-env-audit 生成结构化 verdict；FAIL 时按 checks.*.fix_hint 与 patch_targets 修复并重新审计。&lt;br&gt;落盘：.claude/skills/run-&lt;project&gt;-experiment/env.json、scripts/*；ENV_CONFIG_AUDIT.md/JSON；最终 env.json.status=complete；receipt .aris/runs/&lt;run_id&gt;.experiment-env-manager.&lt;project&gt;.done.json，字段 result、audit_verdict、repair_rounds。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="d9-1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="110" width="820" height="315" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d9-run" value="&lt;b&gt;/run-experiment&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;输入：experiment command、project generated skill。&lt;br&gt;读取：info.sh JSON 的 env_type/backend/connection/resources；prepare.sh 做 pre-flight + code_sync；run.sh 启动并返回 handle；monitor.sh 返回 status/gpu_usage/tail/exit_code/elapsed_seconds/wandb；collect.sh 下载 results/logs。&lt;br&gt;修改/新增：失败时写 .aris/env-config/&lt;project&gt;/error-reports/&lt;timestamp&gt;.json；实验脚本写 JSON/CSV 结果、日志、W&amp;B 指标；Vast auto_destroy=true 时 teardown。&lt;br&gt;判断：prepare/info 失败 → env-manager error-report；完成后 suggestion /analyze-results。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="d9-1">
          <mxGeometry x="980" y="110" width="820" height="315" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d9-queue" value="&lt;b&gt;/experiment-queue&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;触发：≥10 jobs、multi-seed、wave、teacher→student 依赖、OOM 重试。&lt;br&gt;输入：YAML manifest / grid spec / natural language；由 info.sh 注入 ssh、conda、cwd、resources。&lt;br&gt;落盘：本地 experiment-queue/&lt;timestamp&gt;/manifest.json、run_meta.txt；远端 .aris_queue/runs/&lt;timestamp&gt;/manifest.json、queue_state.json、logs/*、queue_mgr.log；scheduler 每 60s 更新 jobs[].status。&lt;br&gt;判断：expected output 存在才 completed；CUDA OOM → bounded retry；依赖 checkpoint 不存在不发下游；最终 summary.md，analyze_on_complete=true 时调用 /analyze-results。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="d9-1">
          <mxGeometry x="1920" y="110" width="820" height="315" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d9-monitor" value="&lt;b&gt;/monitor-experiment&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;输入：server alias 或 experiment name。&lt;br&gt;调用：generated monitor.sh、collect.sh。&lt;br&gt;输出：对比表 Experiment / Metric / Delta vs Baseline / Status；receipt .aris/runs/&lt;run_id&gt;.experiment.&lt;exp&gt;.done.json 字段 status、primary_metric、metrics、gpu_usage、wandb、failure_patterns_matched、elapsed_seconds；不修改主 dashboard。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="d9-1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="520" width="820" height="250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d9-train" value="&lt;b&gt;/training-check&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;输入：W&amp;B entity/project/run_id 或 SSH log；读取 loss trend、eval metrics、NaN/Inf、spike、learning rate、gradient norm。&lt;br&gt;判断：Clearly bad → STOP；Clearly fine → CONTINUE；不确定 → 一次 Codex judgment，输出 WAIT/STOP/CONTINUE。&lt;br&gt;STOP 落盘：保存 W&amp;B URL、关键指标、停止原因到项目 notes；健康时检查间隔 10→20→30→60 min。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="d9-1">
          <mxGeometry x="980" y="520" width="820" height="250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d9-ablate" value="&lt;b&gt;/ablation-planner&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;触发：主结果经 result-to-claim 为 yes/partial、或 reviewer 指出缺少消融。&lt;br&gt;输入：method components、EXPERIMENT_LOG.md/EXPERIMENT_TRACKER.md/W&amp;B、claims、hardware。&lt;br&gt;输出：component ablation、hyperparameter sensitivity、design choice comparison、priority、run order、compute estimate；实现/运行后追加 EXPERIMENT_PLAN.md 与 EXPERIMENT_TRACKER.md，结果写 EXPERIMENT_LOG.md。&lt;br&gt;每个 ablation 必须有 what_it_tests 和 expected_if_component_matters。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="d9-1">
          <mxGeometry x="1920" y="520" width="820" height="250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d9-fail" value="&lt;b&gt;共同失败转移&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;实验执行 skill 不直接修改 auto-research-loop 的 dashboard。它们把机器事实写到结果/receipt/error-report；上层 worker 读取后才转换成 dashboard_patch；主 loop 只接受受限字段。" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="d9-1">
          <mxGeometry x="650" y="875" width="1220" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d9-flow1" value="Phase 0 / sanity failure" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="d9-1" source="d9-env" target="d9-run">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d9-flow2" value="小批量" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="d9-1" source="d9-run" target="d9-monitor">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d9-flow3" value="大批量/依赖" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="d9-1" source="d9-run" target="d9-queue">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d9-flow4" value="W&amp;B 开启" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="d9-1" source="d9-monitor" target="d9-train">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d9-flow5" value="主结果 positive" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="d9-1" source="d9-monitor" target="d9-ablate">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d9-source" value="源码依据：skills/experiment-env-manager/SKILL.md；run-experiment/SKILL.md；experiment-queue/SKILL.md；monitor-experiment/SKILL.md；training-check/SKILL.md；ablation-planner/SKILL.md。" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="d9-1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1080" width="1500" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="deps-review" name="10 相关 skill：分析、审查与发布">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1900" dy="1300" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2800" pageHeight="2300" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="d10-0" />
        <mxCell id="d10-1" parent="d10-0" />
        <mxCell id="d10-title" value="Auto Review / Analyze / Render / Paper 的输入输出边界" style="text;html=1;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="d10-1">
          <mxGeometry x="700" y="20" width="1400" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d10-analyze" value="&lt;b&gt;/analyze-results&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;输入（worker 模式）：manifest.inputs.results、tracker，optional experiment_plan、experiment_skill、error_report；只读这些路径，不扫项目根 results/logs/refine-logs。&lt;br&gt;Phase 2：比较表按 model/hyperparameter/data/seed 分组，算 baseline delta；多 seed 算 mean±std、p-value，找 outlier；每个 finding 写 observation/interpretation/implication/next step。&lt;br&gt;Phase 3：派 fresh Codex verifier 写 .aris/env-config/&lt;project&gt;/ANALYSIS_AUDIT.md/.json；FAIL 时由用户选择补充、跳过或 override。&lt;br&gt;输出：outputs/EXPERIMENT_RESULTS.md；receipt.dashboard_patch.metric.current、metric.delta、statistical_significance，summary.verdict/iterations。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="d10-1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="110" width="820" height="355" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d10-review" value="&lt;b&gt;/auto-review-loop&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;输入：analysis/tracker/results/experiment_plan/experiment_skill/idea_report；context.target_metric、metric_history、reviewer_model。&lt;br&gt;内部 round：reviewer 读文件 → 提取 score/verdict/actions → 修 code/experiment/analysis/docs → monitor → 记录 raw response；score≥6 AND ready/almost 才停，MAX_ROUNDS=4。&lt;br&gt;终止落盘：AUTO_REVIEW.md、REVIEW_STATE.json、final-inputs/EXPERIMENT_RESULTS.md、final-inputs/EXPERIMENT_TRACKER.md、final-analysis/EXPERIMENT_RESULTS.md；可选 CLAIMS_FROM_RESULTS.md、AUTO_REVIEW.html。&lt;br&gt;receipt.patch：last_review.verdict/score/reviewer_id + final metric fields。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="d10-1">
          <mxGeometry x="980" y="110" width="820" height="355" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d10-claim" value="&lt;b&gt;/result-to-claim（auto-review 终止可选）&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;输入：W&amp;B、EXPERIMENT_LOG.md、EXPERIMENT_TRACKER.md、logs、research_contract；先写 .aris/claims.json {id,value,source}，运行 evidence pre-check 生成 .aris/evidence_precheck.json。&lt;br&gt;Codex 判断：claim_supported=yes|partial|no、what_results_support/don&#39;t_support、missing_evidence、suggested_claim_revision、next_experiments_needed、confidence。&lt;br&gt;写 CLAIMS_FROM_RESULTS.md；若 wiki 存在，只添加 experiment edges，不改 claim.status、不创建 claim 节点。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="d10-1">
          <mxGeometry x="1920" y="110" width="820" height="355" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d10-render" value="&lt;b&gt;/render-html&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;输入：选定的 MD/JSON（IDEA_REPORT、AUTO_REVIEW、NARRATIVE_REPORT、research-wiki 等），可带 --state/--json sidecar。&lt;br&gt;动作：识别 artifact、选 academic/dashboard 模板、调用纯 stdlib helper；Markdown 是源，HTML 只是阅读视图。&lt;br&gt;输出：同目录 .html，内含 source SHA256；worker receipt.dashboard_patch.html_rendered=true。academic 默认需要 fresh Codex 做 fidelity/structure/safety review；auto-loop/summary 明确传 --no-review；失败不阻断上游。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="d10-1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="560" width="820" height="300" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d10-paper" value="&lt;b&gt;/paper-writing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;输入：NARRATIVE_REPORT.md、research-wiki、final result/analysis、dashboard；支持直接 PAPER_PLAN.md 或研究方向+结果。&lt;br&gt;固定链：paper-plan → paper-figure → paper-write → paper-compile → auto-paper-improvement-loop；可选 figurespec/gemini/mermaid/codex-image2 生成架构图。&lt;br&gt;最终 assurance=submission 时必须有 PROOF_AUDIT.json、PAPER_CLAIM_AUDIT.json、CITATION_AUDIT.json（必要时 KILL_ARGUMENT.json），再由 verify_paper_audits.sh 判 exit code。&lt;br&gt;输出 paper/：PDF、TeX、figures、审计报告、audit-verifier-report.json；receipt.patch.paper_status/audit_passed。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="d10-1">
          <mxGeometry x="980" y="560" width="820" height="300" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d10-authority" value="&lt;b&gt;字段来源的先后关系&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;实验原始数据 → analyze-results 的结构化 metric → dashboard.metric.current；reviewer 的 score/verdict → dashboard.last_review；metric-gate 只用 dashboard.metric 与 history 决定停止；gap-planner 只用 supplied evidence 做 gap 变更；paper verifier 的 exit code 才能给 paper-writing accept。" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="d10-1">
          <mxGeometry x="650" y="970" width="1220" height="135" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d10-a1" value="结构化 metric" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="d10-1" source="d10-analyze" target="d10-review">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d10-a2" value="最终 claim" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="d10-1" source="d10-review" target="d10-claim">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d10-a3" value="报告 MD" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="d10-1" source="d10-review" target="d10-render">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d10-a4" value="NARRATIVE_REPORT" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="d10-1" source="d10-review" target="d10-paper">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d10-source" value="源码依据：skills/analyze-results/SKILL.md；auto-review-loop/SKILL.md；result-to-claim/SKILL.md；render-html/SKILL.md；paper-writing/SKILL.md。" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="d10-1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1190" width="1500" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="files" name="11 文件与字段责任">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1900" dy="1300" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2800" pageHeight="2400" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="d11-0" />
        <mxCell id="d11-1" parent="d11-0" />
        <mxCell id="d11-title" value="可落盘文件、写入者和字段边界" style="text;html=1;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="d11-1">
          <mxGeometry x="700" y="20" width="1400" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d11-dashboard" value="&lt;b&gt;.aris/runs/&lt;run_id&gt;/dashboard.json — 主循环唯一状态源&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;初始化写：run_id、project、status、iteration、max_iterations、current_phase、config{baseline_plan,auto_write,render_html,patience}、metric{name,target,direction,tolerance,baseline,current,history}、best_idea、gaps{open,closed,total}、last_review{verdict,score,reviewer_id}、stop_reason、timestamps、system_errors、applied_receipts。&lt;br&gt;worker 只通过 dashboard_patch 写：bridge→metric.*/experiment_ids；review→last_review.* + final metric；idea→best_idea/idea_ids；gap→gaps.* + paths；summary→summary_path；paper→paper_status/audit_passed；render→html_rendered。&lt;br&gt;metric.history：首次写 iter/value/source/timestamp；同 iteration 再写时替换，不重复追加。" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="d11-1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="105" width="1320" height="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d11-state" value="&lt;b&gt;.aris/runs/&lt;run_id&gt;.json — 外层生命周期&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;run-state 只存 init、loop、summary、paper-writing 四个不重复阶段；每个 phase 字段：phase、status(pending/running/done/failed/accepted/skipped)、artifact、verdict_id、reviewer、updated。&lt;br&gt;accepted 必须带 verdict_id + reviewer；loop 的 accept 只能是 deterministic:&lt;stop_reason&gt;；paper-writing 的 accept 是 deterministic:verify_paper_audits.sh。" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="d11-1">
          <mxGeometry x="1480" y="105" width="1260" height="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d11-worker" value="&lt;b&gt;.aris/runs/&lt;run_id&gt;/workers/&lt;iteration&gt;-&lt;phase&gt;/&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;input-manifest.json：worker、iteration、run_id、inputs（路径）、context（标量）、output_dir。&lt;br&gt;receipt.json：worker、iteration、run_id、status、error、primary_output、summary、dashboard_patch、completed_at、has_errors、error_count；done receipt 的 primary_output 必须存在于 output_dir；failed receipt 不得有 patch。" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="d11-1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="465" width="1320" height="250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d11-arts" value="&lt;b&gt;worker Markdown / JSON 的写者&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;experiment-bridge：EXPERIMENT_RESULTS.md、EXPERIMENT_TRACKER.md、analysis/EXPERIMENT_RESULTS.md；auto-review：AUTO_REVIEW.md、REVIEW_STATE.json、final-inputs/*、final-analysis/*；idea：IDEA_REPORT.md；gap：GAP_AUDIT.json、gap_map.md、GAP_ANALYSIS.md、EXPERIMENT_PLAN.md；summary：NARRATIVE_REPORT.md；paper：paper/；render：同源 .html。&lt;br&gt;这些文件不是 Phase 3 的停止输入，主 orchestrator 只读它们对应 receipt 的结构化 patch。" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="d11-1">
          <mxGeometry x="1480" y="465" width="1260" height="250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d11-wiki" value="&lt;b&gt;research-wiki/ 的 canonical 更改&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Phase 1：receipt.experiments 通过 research-wiki.js add_experiment 写实验实体，字段 slug/title/idea/verdict/confidence/metrics/reasoning/provenance/tags。&lt;br&gt;Phase 4.5：把 gap-planner outputs/gap_map.md 覆盖/同步到 research-wiki/gap_map.md，并 rebuild_query_pack。&lt;br&gt;规则：ideas、experiments、edges 走 helper；gap 只能由 gap-planner 决定；不从 worker raw MD 猜字段。" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="d11-1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="820" width="1320" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d11-config" value="&lt;b&gt;运行/环境配置文件&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;.aris/runs/&lt;run_id&gt;.paseo-config.json：executor_provider、executor_mode、executor_thinking、notify_on_finish。&lt;br&gt;.claude/skills/run-&lt;project&gt;-experiment/env.json：环境 status、backend、connection、paths、resources、wandb、audit；scripts/info.sh、prepare.sh、run.sh、monitor.sh、collect.sh、teardown.sh 是实验原子接口。&lt;br&gt;.aris/env-config/&lt;project&gt;/：prd.json、env-manager-state.json、ENV_CONFIG_AUDIT.md/.json、error-reports/*。" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="d11-1">
          <mxGeometry x="1480" y="820" width="1260" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d11-merge" value="&lt;b&gt;dashboard-merge.js 的保护逻辑&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;校验 run_id、worker、iteration、manifest 所有权、current_phase、primary_output 在 output_dir 内、patch 字段白名单和值类型；重复 receipt 按 applied_receipts 跳过；成功后 dotted path 写入 + metric.history 更新 + system_errors 累加，整份 dashboard 原子替换。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="d11-1">
          <mxGeometry x="650" y="1130" width="1220" height="145" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d11-flow" value="&lt;b&gt;字段流转&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;实验 JSON/CSV/log → analyze-results receipt.metric.current → dashboard.metric.current/history → metric-gate.stop_reason → run-state loop provenance → summary/paper gate。&lt;br&gt;review score/verdict 只走 dashboard.last_review，不进入 stop_reason；idea/gap 只走 best_idea、idea_ids、gaps.*，不由主循环解析 Markdown。" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="d11-1">
          <mxGeometry x="650" y="1360" width="1220" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d11-source" value="源码依据：skills/auto-research-loop/SKILL.md；shared-references/worker-manifest.md；src/tools/dashboard-merge.ts；src/tools/run-state.ts；src/tools/metric-gate.ts。" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="d11-1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1610" width="1500" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
